"""Recognize spreadsheet and structured-data language.

Data, sheet, cell, and formula names get the strongest scores. Record fields
and data-export formats get a smaller score; unrelated tokens are left at zero.
This is a lexical sketch, not a parser, so it misses context-dependent cases.
