"""A sparse lexical approximation of this component.

Give large positive values to control/exit words and smaller values to selected
English and Chinese activity words. Suppress some qualified activity phrases;
reinforce adjacent Chinese activity words. Opening hash signs and tool markup
have separate rules. State contains only the previous token and document label.

These rules capture conspicuous responses, not the many small, token-specific
background activations, which are deliberately approximated by zero.
