"""Activation of layers.0.mlp.down_proj:3416, a "character / string" word detector.

The component fires on the current token when it is a piece of the word
"char" / "character" (and close relatives) or a programming word for text
("string", "str", "bytes"). Its activation depends only on the token itself:
the strongest response is on the bare word "char"/"Char"/"character", a
moderate one on "varchar" and "characteristic"-style words, and a weaker one
on string-type words. Everything else is treated as zero.
