"""Words for people's jobs and titles, and news-report vocabulary.

Layer-0 MLP unit 3428 writes negative values into the residual stream on words that
mark a news story or an official's role: bylines and reporters (记者, journalist,
reporter), editors, officials and titles (主任, 主席, Minister, Senator, CEO), and
news-media words (新华社, 日电, Reuters, 晚报, 电视台, 新闻).

The program predicts a negative value on those words and 0 everywhere else. Reporter
words are the strongest, titles medium, other news words weakest.
"""

READS = ()

REPORTER = {"记者", "编辑", "责任编辑", "主编", "journalist", "journalists", "journalism",
            "reporter", "reporters", "editor", "correspondent", "spokesman", "spokesperson"}
