Turn endings are positive; thought/tool-result endings are negative. Words of
newness have a negative bias, strongest when context has just begun. Chinese and
Japanese newness words have a larger bias. English word classes, writing
systems, case, escapes, quotes, and whitespace add smaller offsets. This is a partial approximation: substantial
word-specific activation variation is not explained here.
"""
READS = ()

